{
  "_comment": [
    "modelSource is the single endpoint every provider's list comes from; one unauthenticated GET",
    "answers for all of them, and results are cached per provider in the reader's settings",
    "document. This shipped file remains read-only at runtime.",
    "models is an offline seed, most common first. Only the seed entries below contain model ids",
    "this project can vouch for.",
    "openRouterPrefix names the vendor part of an OpenRouter id 'vendor/slug', and it is removed",
    "before the id reaches the field. An empty prefix means the whole catalogue with ids left whole,",
    "which is what OpenRouter itself needs: its API takes vendor/slug. A provider with no prefix",
    "gets no list of its own."
  ],
